      "bookmarkId": "31797370_6_1500-1649",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "1500-1649",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "克明俊德，以亲九族①。九族既睦，平章②百姓。百姓③昭明，协和万邦④，黎民於变时雍。",
      "totalCount": 132
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 20504077,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_8_14060-14136",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "14060-14136",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人心①惟危，道心惟微，惟精惟一②，允执厥中。",
      "totalCount": 75
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 353570956,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_17_2297-2413",
      "chapterUid": 17,
      "range": "2297-2413",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "夏王有罪，矫诬①上天，以布命于下。帝用②不臧，式商受命，用爽③厥师。”",
      "totalCount": 68
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 577706267,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_6_14253-14284",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "14253-14284",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "既知之而复用之者何？盖陷溺之民不可以坐视，此又急于救民之仁也。",
      "totalCount": 54
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 539908627,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_9_10736-10751",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "10736-10751",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "大抵天下事，非言之难，惟行之难",
      "totalCount": 54
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 321793034,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_7_15556-15565",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "15556-15565",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "民食既足，教化可兴",
      "totalCount": 48
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 321793034,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_50_9869-10009",
      "chapterUid": 50,
      "range": "9869-10009",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "王曰：“告尔殷多士，今予惟不尔杀，予惟时命有申。今朕作大邑①于兹洛，予惟四方罔攸宾②，亦惟尔多士攸服③奔走臣我多逊。”",
      "totalCount": 48
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 321793034,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_6_12681-12714",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "12681-12714",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "夫君道在乎知人，而知人最为难事。非知其才能之难，乃知其心术之难也。",
      "totalCount": 40
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 26655228,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_6_1336-1379",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "1336-1379",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "其德性之美如此，所以行出来恭敬是着实恭敬，无一些虚伪；行出来谦让是真能谦让，无一些矫强",
      "totalCount": 36
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 15939400,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_6_16120-16143",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "16120-16143",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "夫舜处人伦之变而不失其常如此，非盛德而能之乎？",
      "totalCount": 36
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 229565685,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_7_2745-2753",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "2745-2753",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "舜让于德，弗嗣。",
      "totalCount": 36
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 267411998,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_8_7121-7199",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "7121-7199",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "勉强者，或不能久，故复劝之以九歌，就把百姓每前日歌咏之言，协之律吕，播之声音，用之乡人，用之邦国，以劝相之，使百姓每欢欣鼓舞，趋事赴功。修者常修，和者常和，",
      "totalCount": 36
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 314921992,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_43_11189-11207",
      "chapterUid": 43,
      "range": "11189-11207",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "就使卜而不吉，犹将伐之，况卜而并吉乎",
      "totalCount": 36
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 334392758,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_51_1393-1471",
      "chapterUid": 51,
      "range": "1393-1471",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "相小人，厥父母勤劳稼穑，厥子乃不知稼穑之艰难，乃逸，乃谚。既诞，否则①侮厥父母曰：‘昔之人无闻知。'”",
      "totalCount": 36
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 23011036,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_56_1344-1356",
      "chapterUid": 56,
      "range": "1344-1356",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "制治于未乱，保邦于未危。",
      "totalCount": 36
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 321793034,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_61_5313-5396",
      "chapterUid": 61,
      "range": "5313-5396",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "观《君牙》篇中，论敷典和则，图易思艰，乃人君教养斯民之大务，而又惓惓于顾念旧德，亲任世臣，亹亹然若家人父子相告语者，周家忠厚之风，尚可想见，此孔子所以采录而示后世也。",
      "totalCount": 36
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 32526542,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_3_666-718",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "666-718",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "这是一代帝师张居正为培养万历皇帝，给皇帝上课用的讲稿，因为万历皇帝当时还很年幼，因此讲稿以明代白话文写成",
      "totalCount": 34
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 210871219,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_8_1935-2070",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "1935-2070",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "帝曰：“俞，允若兹，嘉言罔攸①伏，野②无遗贤，万邦咸宁。稽于众，舍己从人，不虐无告，不废③困穷，惟帝时克。”",
      "totalCount": 34
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 4526412,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_8_17192-17265",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "17192-17265",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "官占的方法，是先断定志向，然后用大龟占卜。我的志向已先决定了，征询大家意见，也都相同，鬼神依顺，占卜筮卦的结果也相同，再说占卜也不必重复出现吉兆。",
      "totalCount": 34
    },
    {
      "bookId": "31797370",
      "userVid": 20504077,
      "bookmarkId": "31797370_8_19644-19657",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "19644-19657",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "满招损，谦受益，时乃天道。",
      "totalCount": 34
    }
  ],
